<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">CHINA LURE · WEATHER RANKING</view><view class="title">这一刻，先钓哪种鱼？</view><button bindtap="locations">{{place.name}} · 切换全国地点 ↗</button><input class="input" value="{{query}}" placeholder="搜索翘嘴、桂鱼、黑鱼、马口…" bindinput="search"/><view class="filters"><view><view class="label">鱼种范围</view><picker range="{{scopes}}" value="{{scopeIndex}}" bindchange="scope"><view class="picker">{{scopes[scopeIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="label">水域类型</view><picker range="{{habitats}}" value="{{habitatIndex}}" bindchange="habitat"><view class="picker">{{habitats[habitatIndex]}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="label">比较日期</view><picker range="{{dateOptions}}" value="{{dateIndex}}" bindchange="date"><view class="picker">{{date}} ⌄</view></picker></view><view><view class="label">比较时段</view><picker range="{{hours}}" value="{{hour}}" bindchange="hour"><view class="picker">{{hours[hour]}} ⌄</view></picker></view></view><view class="sub">{{count}}条候选 · 按当前时段指数降序，无数据置后</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="sub">正在计算当地天气条件…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="sub">{{error}}</view><view class="grid"><button class="fishcard {{item.active?'active':''}}" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="select"><text class="rank">{{item.rank}}</text><view class="fish-art"><image src="{{item.image}}" mode="scaleToFill" style="width:300%;height:500%;left:{{item.left}};top:{{item.top}};"/></view><view class="fishname">{{item.name}}</view><view class="score">{{item.score}}</view></button></view><view wx:if="{{!rows.length}}" class="empty">未找到鱼种，请调整搜索。</view><view class="pager" wx:if="{{pageCount>1}}"><button disabled="{{page===0}}" bindtap="previous">上一页</button><text class="small">{{page+1}}/{{pageCount}}</text><button disabled="{{page+1>=pageCount}}" bindtap="next">下一页</button></view><view class="card" id="fish-detail" wx:if="{{detail}}"><view class="row"><view><view class="title">{{detail.name}}</view><view class="sub">{{detail.origin}}</view></view><view class="bigscore">{{detail.score}}</view></view><view>{{detail.label}}</view><view class="sub">{{detail.tip}}</view><view class="sub">拟饵：{{detail.bait}}</view><view class="chart"><view wx:for="{{detail.bars}}" wx:key="hour" class="bar" bindtap="bar" data-hour="{{item.hour}}" style="height:{{item.height}}rpx;background:{{item.valid?'#155ac8':'#dce5f2'}}"/></view><view class="row sub"><text>00时</text><text>12时</text><text>23时</text></view><view class="accent small">当日相对较好：{{detail.best}}</view><view class="reason" wx:for="{{detail.reasons}}" wx:key="*this">{{item}}</view><view class="sub" wx:if="{{detail.missing}}">缺少：{{detail.missing}}</view><view class="sub">经验依据：{{detail.evidence}}</view></view><view class="sub">天气规则0.4在本机计算，无需水温。经验分最高85，非中鱼概率；国内候选不表示当前位置存在该鱼。3D风格静态插画仅作参考。</view></view>
